</section>
</score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Don’t make my way</l><l>Don’t take my chance</l><l>Don’t make my choice</l><l>Let me choose this way.</l><l> </l><l> You know and I know that the road is long</l><l> The way is narrow and the price is high</l><l> Won’t you let me choose</l><l> Let me choose this way</l><l> Won’t let me taste and know,</l><l> Let me taste and know my God?</l><l> Let me waste my life and all,</l><l> Waste all that I have on Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Don’t give me a</l><l>Secondhand saviour</l><l>Won’t you let me</l><l>Taste Him firsthand?</l><l> </l><l> I can’t assure you how the path will be</l><l> I cannot tell you what a sacrifice</l><l> But if you would let</l><l> You would let me fall</l><l> Let me fall into His mercy</l><l> Let me fall into His grace</l><l> Let me fall into His will</l><l> Then everything will be alright.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Don’t make my way</l><l>Don’t take my chance</l><l>Don’t make my choice</l><l>Let me choose this way.</l></lg>
</div>
</back></music></mei>
